// Ch8 B17 "The wall falls" (act1_ch08.md §2 B17; W20 → W21 → W22 → W23 → W22 → W24 → W25).
// Letterboxed, scripted. Played when the Reach's battle ends in its scripted escape.
// W20: the Breach lands. The wall-head section to the stair's seaward side goes, its Watchers tipping
// out into the storm, and the sea comes through the gap into the low town in one long grey slide. The
// stair was not wide enough: the low town's far lanes, where people were still coming, going under.
// Wide, unlit except by the storm. No close-ups of the drowning (pillar 1: sorrow, not spectacle).
// W21: Rhen at the new lip, back to camera. W22 (his POV): inside the storm wall, a single cyan
// silhouette, a man's shape, faceless, standing in the storm as if on a deck. The current-song (Dace's,
// the same melody as Ch1's statement), diegetic, from Rhen's position only. W23: CU Rhen, held >= 3 s.
// THIS IS A FREEZE: no step toward it, no reach, no word (rule 4). W22: the figure TURNS AWAY into the
// dark and is gone, sideways and down, never up; the song goes with it.
// W24: from behind Rhen, Kerrid's LEFT hand, wrapped in tarred hauling-cloth, takes his collar and hauls
// him back off the lip as it falls away. He has just come up the drowned stair, the last man up it. No
// rope-burn glow (ADR 0022 (g)). FRAME RULE: Kerrid never shares a frame with the figure; the figure is
// gone before his hand enters W24. W25: Rhen on his back on the wet stone; Kerrid already turning to look
// down the stair, which is now just sea, for a long beat, the way a man counts. Kerrid has no line.
// The choice: Asha reaches Rhen. Sets ch08_wall_fell and ch08_rhen_froze; the first option sets
// ch08_rhen_told_asha.
title: ch08_wall_falls
location: ch08/corrow
---
@letterbox on
@camera W20
@sfx wall_breach
@music undertow_reach
@wait 3.0
<<set $ch08_wall_fell = true>>
@camera W21
@mark rhen breach_lip walk
@wait 1.5
@camera W22
@music silence fade=0.5
@sfx current_song at=figure
@wait 2.0
@camera W23
@face rhen afraid 0.3
@wait 3.5
<<set $ch08_rhen_froze = true>>
@camera W22
@mark figure figure_gone walk
@wait 2.0
@camera W24
@mark kerrid kerrid_collar run
@anim kerrid catch_collar rhen
@sfx stone_falls
@mark rhen rhen_fallen walk
@wait 1.5
@camera W25
@mark kerrid kerrid_drowned_stair walk
@anim kerrid look_at drowned_stair
@wait 3.0
@mark asha asha_to_rhen run
Asha [worried]: Rhen. What did you see? #line:ch08_wall_falls_001
-> Someone. In the storm. Humming a current-song. #line:ch08_wall_falls_002
    Asha [sad]: I heard them too. All of them. #line:ch08_wall_falls_003
    <<set $ch08_rhen_told_asha = true>>
-> Storm. Just the storm. #line:ch08_wall_falls_004
    Asha [tender]: All right. #line:ch08_wall_falls_005
@wait 1.0
@letterbox off
===
